WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:12.367
Templates give your team ready-made pages, from a standard operating procedure to a marketing plan, so nobody starts from a blank page. In this video, you’ll browse them, open one, and use it.

00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:21.412
Open Templates, under Spaces. There are dozens, in categories from operations and the team, to customers, marketing and finance.

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:31.744
Each one says how many sections it has. Open one to see it: its sections come out as numbered, colored cards, here, in the editor, and in every page made from it.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.552
Click Use template to start a page from it, in the space you choose, and fill it in.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:46.195
Templates cover the whole business: onboarding guides and job descriptions for the team, quotes and complaint forms for customers, and plans for marketing.

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:52.052
They also show up when you add a page in Spaces, so the right starting point is one click away.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:58.943
Or click New to save your own company’s templates, like your way of writing a shift handover, for everyone to use.

